message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "LogChirpy - Ornithological Archival App"
abstract: >
  LogChirpy is a mobile app for bird identification and observation logging.
  It combines BirdNET-based audio classification and MobileNet image recognition
  with a 25,000+ species taxonomic database (Clements). Features include
  GPS-tagged sightings, a species encyclopaedia (BirDex), photo archiving, and
  multilingual support — designed to support citizen-science ornithological fieldwork.
